map Ports of the Sweet Trade
subtitle Marker size is the Captain's tally of chests that passed through each port

tag Port as p
  Pirate Haven green
  Treasure Port red
  Fence blue
  Careening orange

poi 25.05 -77.35 as nassau label: Nassau, p: Pirate Haven, size: 60
poi 20.03 -72.78 as tortuga label: Tortuga, p: Pirate Haven, size: 45
  note New hands sign on
    Fifty men mustered in **one week**.
poi Kingston label: Port Royal, p: Fence, size: 50
poi Havana p: Treasure Port, size: 90
poi Cartagena p: Treasure Port, size: 80
poi 9.55 -79.65 as portobelo label: Portobelo, p: Treasure Port, size: 100
  note The fair that fills the hold
    Spanish plate waits for the galleons.
    Bosun counts **100 chests** taken.
poi 19.20 -96.13 as veracruz label: Veracruz, p: Treasure Port, size: 70
poi 16.40 -86.40 as roatan label: Roatán, p: Careening, size: 20
  note Hulls scraped clean
    Three ships careened before the season.
poi 12.11 -68.93 as curacao label: Curaçao, p: Fence, size: 35
poi 18.07 -73.64 as vache label: Île-à-Vache, p: Careening, size: 15
